{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, the cats have taken over the cinema! Mewseum: Film Festival is a relaxing pixel art puzzle game set in a charming feline universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a featured movie, solve each grid, and gradually reveal the hidden poster. With every artwork completed, the museum fills with charm and sparkle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/86600bb498fe1f3f1397abed53ebe3d1.poster.avif?t=1769108966\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/86600bb498fe1f3f1397abed53ebe3d1.webm?t=1769108966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/86600bb498fe1f3f1397abed53ebe3d1.mp4?t=1769108966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE THE PUZZLE AND REVEAL THE IMAGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete each grid by drawing rectangles or squares following two simple rules:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each section you draw must contain exactly one number.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number indicates the exact size of the section you need to draw.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/4e9b16ac4d84b0381acd669ad2288185.poster.avif?t=1769108966\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/4e9b16ac4d84b0381acd669ad2288185.webm?t=1769108966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/4e9b16ac4d84b0381acd669ad2288185.mp4?t=1769108966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A VARIETY OF FILMS ON EXHIBITION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 6 famous movies reimagined in the feline universe, with hundreds of puzzles to solve. Each grid offers quick sessions perfect for a casual break, or long hours of relaxing gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RELAX AND HAVE FUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles come in different levels of difficulty depending on the grid size. If you need help, you can use hints or undo moves at any time. Relax to a cozy jazz soundtrack while discovering amazing pixel art masterpieces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add it to your wishlist now and get ready for the film festival!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985760?t=1769108966","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/037b35950f89257b1afeda6df2f4a726e225d468/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769108966","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/8e79388e220bad1ac82ebfe836a7613db2b77c2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769108966","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/8e79388e220bad1ac82ebfe836a7613db2b77c2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769108966","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3985780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, the cats have taken over the cinema! Mewseum: Film Festival is a relaxing pixel art puzzle game set in a charming feline universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a featured movie, solve each grid, and gradually reveal the hidden poster. With every artwork completed, the museum fills with charm and sparkle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/86600bb498fe1f3f1397abed53ebe3d1.poster.avif?t=1769108966\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/86600bb498fe1f3f1397abed53ebe3d1.webm?t=1769108966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/86600bb498fe1f3f1397abed53ebe3d1.mp4?t=1769108966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE THE PUZZLE AND REVEAL THE IMAGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete each grid by drawing rectangles or squares following two simple rules:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each section you draw must contain exactly one number.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number indicates the exact size of the section you need to draw.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/4e9b16ac4d84b0381acd669ad2288185.poster.avif?t=1769108966\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/4e9b16ac4d84b0381acd669ad2288185.webm?t=1769108966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/4e9b16ac4d84b0381acd669ad2288185.mp4?t=1769108966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A VARIETY OF FILMS ON EXHIBITION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 6 famous movies reimagined in the feline universe, with hundreds of puzzles to solve. Each grid offers quick sessions perfect for a casual break, or long hours of relaxing gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RELAX AND HAVE FUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles come in different levels of difficulty depending on the grid size. If you need help, you can use hints or undo moves at any time. Relax to a cozy jazz soundtrack while discovering amazing pixel art masterpieces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add it to your wishlist now and get ready for the film festival!</strong></p>","developers":["New Dawn Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/4e6810f317691ab8802c543cc26b7cf07fb80a3c/header.jpg?t=1769108966","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card supporting DirectX 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3985760/65150